Sysroot management commands

Usage: souc sysroot [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list          List installed sysroots
  show          Show sysroot for a specific target
  stdlib-paths  Show stdlib search paths and configuration
  install       Install sysroot for a target
  remove        Remove installed sysroot
  clean         Clean stale sysroots
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose  Enable verbose output
  -h, --help     Print help
